From dc63b756ceab47b849208b93411bab9e9c9aaadb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: eileenthg <40307498+eileenthg@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 14:05:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix JEI integration for JEI 19.40+ on 1.21.1

JEI 19.40 moved the ingredient grid behind IIngredientListOverlayContents,
removed IngredientGridWithNavigation$UserInputHandler, and split
IngredientListOverlay drawing into background/foreground passes, so both
JEI mixins failed to apply.

On 1.21.1 the mixins now gate each call from IngredientListOverlay into its
contents (draw, tooltips, hover) and wrap the grid's input handler for the
Show/Hide Recipes buttons. Hidden ingredients can no longer be clicked,
scrolled or hovered. The 1.20.1 code is unchanged behind #else. On JEI older
than 19.40 the plugin skips the JEI mixins with a warning instead of crashing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
